  "If true, internal users cannot create models or auto routers through the UI or API, including team admins and members with auto-router management permission. Proxy admins are exempt. Editing and deleting existing models are unchanged.": "启用后，普通用户、团队管理员及有自动路由管理权限的成员均不能通过界面或 API 创建模型或自动路由。平台管理员不受影响，已有模型的编辑和删除权限保持原样",
  "Prevents Team Admins from deleting users from the teams they manage. Useful for SCIM provisioning where team membership is defined externally.": "禁止团队管理员移除所管理团队中的成员，适用于由 SCIM 等外部系统维护团队成员关系的场景",
  "If true, users cannot specify custom key values. All keys must be auto-generated.": "启用后，用户不能自定义密钥值，所有密钥均由系统自动生成",
  "List of page keys that internal users (non-admins) can see in the UI sidebar. If not set, all pages are visible based on role permissions.": "配置普通用户可见的页面。未设置时，根据用户角色显示所有有权访问的页面",
  "Team settings fields a team admin may change on the teams they administer. With 'max_budget' alone a team admin may keep or lower the team budget; add 'raise_max_budget' to also let them raise it. A raise is capped by the organization's max_budget when the team belongs to one, has no ceiling for teams outside an organization or in an organization without a budget, and never removes the cap. Include 'projects' to let team admins create and update projects for those teams. Include 'member_key_budgets' to let team admins update budget fields on keys owned by other members of those teams. Include 'create_member_keys' to let team admins create team keys owned by other members of those teams. Those keys can only call LLM API routes, and the member must be an internal user. Empty means team admins cannot edit team settings or manage projects at all. Proxy admins and org admins are not affected.": "配置团队管理员可编辑的团队字段。仅启用 max_budget 时，只能保持或降低团队预算；启用 raise_max_budget 后也可提高预算。属于组织的团队受组织预算上限约束，未加入组织或所属组织未设预算的团队没有此上限，提高预算不会移除已有上限。projects 允许管理团队项目，member_key_budgets 允许修改其他成员密钥的预算，create_member_keys 允许为普通内部成员创建仅可调用模型 API 的团队密钥。留空表示团队管理员不能编辑团队设置或管理项目，平台管理员和组织管理员不受影响",
  "Team settings fields a team admin may change on the teams they administer.": "配置团队管理员可编辑的团队设置字段",
